285	        // Pick every remaining node whose parent (if any) and every
286	        // `depends_on` row are already terminal (completed or skipped), in
287	        // deterministic BFS order. Whether a skipped/failed prerequisite
288	        // *skips* the node is decided in the unit loop below — readiness only
289	        // asks "is there anything left to wait for".
